WEBVTT

00:33:27.401 --> 00:33:32.724
and you see the level of
not just indignation but pessimism ...

00:33:32.748 --> 00:33:36.506
I was with a woman in South Carolina --
she was an older woman --

00:33:36.530 --> 00:33:37.923
she said, "I grew up in 1953.

00:33:37.947 --> 00:33:39.954
It's worse for young African American kids

00:33:39.978 --> 00:33:42.184
in my neighborhood
than it was when I grew up."

00:33:42.208 --> 00:33:45.653
And when you see that level of pessimism,
that level of disenchantment,

00:33:45.677 --> 00:33:47.755
at the same time you have
the Trump election

00:33:47.779 --> 00:33:50.374
and you have, really,
our political divides overlapping

00:33:50.398 --> 00:33:51.944
with our racial divides,

00:33:51.968 --> 00:33:55.183
you come to the conclusion
something unusual needs to be done.

00:33:55.207 --> 00:33:57.140
And that was my conclusion.

00:33:57.618 --> 00:34:00.414
CA: On the right, they might also say,